Algorithm 
1.Start
2.Import required libraries:
pandas for data handling
matplotlib.pyplot for plotting
3. Create a DataFrame with:
4. Names of individuals
Their monthly spending values
5. Convert the Monthly_spend column from string to integer type
6.Sort the DataFrame in ascending order based on monthly spend
7. Create a figure for plotting
8. Plot a bar graph using:
9.Names on X-axis
10. Monthly spend on Y-axis
11.Label the X-axis as “Name”
12 Label the Y-axis as “Monthly Spend”
Add title “Monthly Spend (Sorted)”
Display the graph using show()
